    "instructions": "First practise G bass alone on low E fret 3, then the opening G-C phrase twice. Add bass only to the G bars; C and D are melody only. After the preparation, play the complete twelve-bar tune twice, with one full rest bar between the performances. The first full tune starts at bar 10, including the two count-in bars. Vertically aligned TAB numbers play together. Play only written notes; unclear voices may remain yellow.",
